# For many rows: each formatted as it comes, then all of them cleaned and cut in one pass (a
# process per row is minutes for a queue a worker flooded). The rows wait in a temp file of
# uncleaned queue text: gone at exit, whatever stops the listing (Ctrl+C, a closed pipe).
